SUMMARY:Dumpster Demons Tour feat. Candi Carpenter and Moselle
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Dumpster Demons Tour feat. Candi Carpenter and Moselle Join Can
 di Carpenter and Moselle for an evening of indie and alternative pop music
  celebrating Candi’s latest EP\, Biblically Accurate Angel\, and Moselle
 ’s forthcoming album\, Gargoyle. Through powerhouse vocals and fearless 
 storytelling\, both artists explore themes of toxic religion\, trauma\, id
 entity\, and self-discovery with equal parts vulnerability\, humor\, and h
 eart. Expect an unforgettable evening of cathartic songs\, intimate moment
 s\, and dynamic performances that invite audiences to laugh\, heal\, and c
 elebrate the beautifully messy human experience.\nhttps://therockwell.org/
 calendar/dumpster-demons-tour/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
 boston/
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/dumpster-demons-tour/
END:VEVENT
