SUMMARY:Jiwon\, Sally Boy\, & Jazz Cuti
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Jiwon\, Sally Boy\, & Jazz Cuti ARTIST BIO: jiwon is from nyc a
 nd grew up immersed in a diverse musical environment. proficient in piano\
 , cello\, bass guitar\, and drums\, Jiwon found music to be his expressive
  refuge. his style\, an eclectic mix inspired by artists like Lou Reed and
  Jai Paul\, defies easy categorization. while studying philosophy at harva
 rd\, he deepened his musical commitment\, and during the pandemic\, major 
 label interest affirmed his career choice. jiwon’s recent single “tele
 phone” received critical acclaim for its introspective and authentic sou
 nd. as he continues to innovate\, jiwon remains dedicated to his craft\, d
 istinguishing himself with genuine passion and sincerity in a crowded musi
 cal landscape.\nhttps://therockwell.org/calendar/jiwon-sallyboy-jazzcuti/\
 nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/jiwon-sallyboy-jazzcuti/
END:VEVENT
