DTSTART:20261015T230000Z
DTEND:20261016T010000Z
SUMMARY:Jamie Webster
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Music with rare meaning\, ‘people’s poet’ Jamie Webster h
 as built a movement around songcraft that distils struggle\, finds hope an
 d the tugs at the ties that bind. Creating pin-sharp pictures of people he
  sees around him striving and failing\, through no fault of their own\, to
  make better lives\, Webster’s motivations and inspirations are unambigu
 ous.\nhttps://therockwell.org/calendar/jamie-webster/\nFrom Pushpin Boston
 : https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/jamie-webster/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
